uld have and should have been. Had this been developed solely in Arkane's vision, I'd wager it would have been one of the best Immersive sims in recent memory. As I said, even in it's current state, playing solo and offline, I'm enjoying my time thoroughly and don't want it to end.\n\nSure, some of the characters are bit awkward and lame but the gameplay and immersive world keeps me engrossed. Such a shame, definitely pick it up whenever it's on sale.", "timestamp_created": 1733503948, "timestamp_updated": 1734696338, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 12, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.576242685317993164", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182020714", "author": {"steamid": "76561199486046924", "personaname": "WildWellsLegacy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199486046924/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1086, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 582, "last_played": 1734615467, "avatar": "96740adfc230bdaf2008f954ea8d943b1f3fc37a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Besides what was said about the launch of the game, they have fixed this game! It is fun and exciting, and I'd really like to see some expansions or updates if the game is still being adjusted. 10/10 would recommend.", "timestamp_created": 1733474357, "timestamp_updated": 1733474357, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 9, "votes_funny": 6, "weighted_vote_score": "0.425938040018081665", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "181951236", "author": {"steamid": "76561199096370546", "perso